---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="CompareVue privacy policy — what data we collect and how we use it.">
  <!-- ═══ Hero ═══ -->
  <header class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-50/60 via-white to-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #2563eb 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
    <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 pt-14 sm:pt-20 pb-10 sm:pb-14 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="mb-6 text-sm text-gray-400" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
          <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
          <li class="text-gray-500" aria-current="page">Privacy</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-gray-400">Last updated: June 10, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="prose prose-lg prose-gray max-w-none
      prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-headings:text-gray-900
      prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:mt-14 prose-h2:mb-5
      prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:text-gray-700
      prose-a:text-brand-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline prose-a:font-medium
      prose-strong:text-gray-900 prose-strong:font-semibold
      prose-li:marker:text-gray-400
    ">
      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you visit comparevue.com, we automatically collect basic usage data including browser type and pages visited. We collect your email address only when you voluntarily subscribe to our newsletter or contact us.</p>
      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use collected information to operate the Site, send newsletters you've opted into, respond to inquiries, and analyze usage to improve our content.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and Affiliate Links</h2>
      <p>We may use cookies for site functionality. Some links are affiliate links — our partners may use cookies to track referrals. You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>
      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data by contacting us at hello@comparevue.com.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions? Reach us at <strong>hello@comparevue.com</strong> or visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
